spell_flavour_text = "Not a shield. A disagreement with the physics of incoming spells."
theory_desc = "Destructive wave interference. Caster projects inverse-phase mana waves against incoming projectile spells, cancelling not blocking them. A cancelled spell leaves zero aura residue. Ineffective against melee — insufficient propagation distance to phase-cancel.
Synergy: Dampening Field covers the long cast window of Resonance Crack and Focal Point."
